# 换行策略：仓库内统一以 LF 存储。
# 批处理/脚本按 Windows 惯例钉 CRLF（GBK 编码文件换行被改写会损坏）。
* text=auto
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# 二进制文件禁止文本转换
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.bmp binary
*.wav binary
*.mp3 binary
*.mp4 binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.7z binary
*.pdf binary
